  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerz_riot/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_d07d8934-0938-40a3-9a98-35115ec750cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fgamerz_riot07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_b489e76c-8d04-4cc4-974f-8ee9c9a5b7c6.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cJ3bs3XxHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7bf6a59b-bf4a-4867-8bdf-2d31fd360227.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Gamerz_Riot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7f1a7c2a-b5f5-4a60-a7f4-280b1e85792b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">連結</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span></strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&amp;psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&amp;ust=1668095020051000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">⮞</span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252foneblock-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">OneBlock Reborn</span> [資料包]</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">⮜</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&amp;psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&amp;ust=1668095020051000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\">⮞</span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/skyblock-horizon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">SkyBlock Horizon</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"> [地圖]</span></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⮜</span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">在最終的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21 更新</span>之後，OneBlock Reborn 地圖<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">將會成為一個獨立的地圖生成資料包</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></pre><hr><h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"> </span></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f0f\"><strong>Oneblock Reborn</strong></span> 是一張冒險地圖，它是 <strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 地圖</strong>的延續。在這張地圖中，你將出生在一個漂浮於虛空之上的單一方塊上。這個方塊是無限的，會根據不同的生態域經歷不同的階段。這張地圖充滿了冒險與挑戰。</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯ </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">在社交媒體上展示時請標註來源。</span></strong></span></span></h1><p>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下載 OneBlock：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn</a><br>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下載原版 (IJAMinecraft)：<a href=\"ijaminecraft.com/map/oneblock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ijaminecraft.com/oneblock</a></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⛯ </span>關於：&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在這張地圖中，你將出生在一個單一方塊上。此張地圖包含15個階段，每個階段都有不同且獨特的主題。你還可以進入<span style=\"color:#f00\">地獄</span>或<span style=\"color:#00f\">終界</span>。<br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">方塊和生物會根據地圖中的階段生成。此圖中新增了方解石和凝灰岩的合成配方（請見圖片）。</span></strong></span></span>&nbsp; OneBlock Reborn 以前的名稱是 OneBlock Classic。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>影片教學</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:255px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rvbzk_GaeJw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:261px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7TOImSxgZts?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:262px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kmjZSxd0h1A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>！如何安裝！（單人模式）</strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下載地圖並使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解壓縮。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">解壓縮後你會得到一個資料夾。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然後將資料夾<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>複製</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>或<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>移動</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>到 <span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>minecraft saves</strong></span> 資料夾中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">就這樣，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><strong>OneBlock</strong></span> 就安裝完成了。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在你就可以在 <strong>Minecraft</strong> 中享受它了。<br></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>！如何安裝！（多人模式）</strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下載地圖並使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解壓縮。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然後將解壓縮後的資料夾<em><strong>重新命名</strong></em>為 \"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\"。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">接著，<span style=\"color:#036\"><strong><em><strong><em>上傳</em></strong>名為 \"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\" 的資料夾到你的伺服器主機</em></strong></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">就這樣，<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">OneBlock</span></strong></span> 就在你的 <strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">伺服器</span></strong> 上安裝完成了。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">現在你就可以在你的 <strong>Minecraft 伺服器</strong> 上享受它了。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>鳴謝 / 連結</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/IJAMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 YouTube 頻道。</strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fijaminecraft.com%252fmap%252foneblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 專案。</strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxC-rDu4a2SKFdDPXfVxmw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong></span></span></span></p>",
